>> x := [' hallo '].

>> y := x osonhlamvukazi.
Okuphumayo bhala: x, umugqa-omusha.
Okuphumayo bhala: (x kuyefana: y), umugqa-omusha.

>> y := x izinhlamvu-ezincane.
Okuphumayo bhala: x, umugqa-omusha.
Okuphumayo bhala: (x kuyefana: y), umugqa-omusha.

>> y := x sika-izikhala.
Okuphumayo bhala: x, umugqa-omusha.
Okuphumayo bhala: (x kuyefana: y), umugqa-omusha.

>> y := x yeqa: 1.
Okuphumayo bhala: x, umugqa-omusha.
Okuphumayo bhala: (x kuyefana: y), umugqa-omusha.

>> y := x kusuka: 1 ubude: 2.
Okuphumayo bhala: x, umugqa-omusha.
